d ordered the legislature  to put me back in so that's always been  kind of a lifeline to me do something  you can live with I never won't do  something i would be embarrassed by  something that i'd be ashamed of later  although i'm sure i've done some things  I shouldn't have done but I I've just  have like that statement do something  you can live with and you know  I've tried to always do something I can  live with and so far I've been able to  do so
 

